WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.009 --> 00:00:02.074
(rock music)

00:00:05.144 --> 00:00:06.774
(rewinding)

00:00:11.258 --> 00:00:13.660
- I would never invite work
friends to a birthday party.

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:16.007
- Oh, I will take an open bar any day.

00:00:16.007 --> 00:00:18.266
- Work. Pleasure. Bad combo.

00:00:18.266 --> 00:00:20.068
- No, no it's not! Look!

00:00:20.068 --> 00:00:21.257
Work.

00:00:21.257 --> 00:00:22.624
Pleasure.

00:00:22.624 --> 00:00:23.669
- Oh!

00:00:23.669 --> 00:00:25.314
It's a fiesta-bomb. You want some?

00:00:25.314 --> 00:00:27.845
- It's 7:30 on a Tuesday!

00:00:27.845 --> 00:00:28.913
- Oh, live a little.

00:00:28.913 --> 00:00:31.910
- I can't show you guys the real me.

00:00:31.910 --> 00:00:33.046
Look at Kalen.

00:00:33.046 --> 00:00:36.422
- Uh, is this guy bothering you?

00:00:36.422 --> 00:00:37.377
- No.

00:00:37.377 --> 00:00:41.459
- Oh, OK. Hey! Is that guy bothering you?

00:00:41.459 --> 00:00:42.544
- Yeah, that's his move.

00:00:42.544 --> 00:00:43.819
- That can't possibly ever work.

00:00:43.819 --> 00:00:45.790
- Ah, probability, man.

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:48.482
- Well, I don't wanna know
what my drunk pick up line is.

00:00:48.482 --> 00:00:50.485
- You don't have to go crazy or anything.

00:00:50.485 --> 00:00:53.129
Uh, by the way, this is number five.

00:00:54.849 --> 00:00:56.347
(inaudible chatting)

00:00:57.747 --> 00:00:59.538
I mean, at least he's meeting people.

00:00:59.538 --> 00:01:01.163
- I bet he's asking her what her sign is.

00:01:01.163 --> 00:01:04.112
- So, it turns out, if you drill a hole

00:01:04.112 --> 00:01:05.900
through the centre of a hotdog

00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:10.517
and then replace the core with
some even lower quality meat,

00:01:10.517 --> 00:01:12.471
consumers can't even tell the difference.

00:01:12.471 --> 00:01:13.841
- I had no idea a business consultant

00:01:13.841 --> 00:01:16.163
would know so much about meat.

00:01:16.163 --> 00:01:18.810
- Oh, well, we consultants are ready

00:01:18.810 --> 00:01:20.528
to handle any consumer needs.

00:01:20.528 --> 00:01:23.947
- I can just picture you out
there on the factory floor

00:01:23.947 --> 00:01:26.738
walking around in those cloud shoes.

00:01:26.738 --> 00:01:29.307
- What, like, sanitary boots?

00:01:29.307 --> 00:01:32.938
- Yeah, gotta get me some of them booties.

00:01:32.938 --> 00:01:34.690
- What is it you do?

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:37.157
- I'm not really sure.

00:01:37.157 --> 00:01:39.078
- If I was ready to meet someone,

00:01:39.078 --> 00:01:41.000
I wouldn't just pick 'em up at a bar.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.171
- But you're not meeting anyone anywhere.

00:01:43.171 --> 00:01:45.181
- I did online.

00:01:45.181 --> 00:01:48.117
That way, I know exactly
what I'm gonna get.

00:01:48.117 --> 00:01:52.794
- Wow. That is a real celebration
of life's serendipity.

00:01:52.794 --> 00:01:55.471
- It's like having a
baseball card of the person

00:01:55.471 --> 00:01:57.248
before you even meet them.

00:01:58.276 --> 00:01:58.919
- Oh god.

00:01:58.919 --> 00:02:00.428
- That's incredible!

00:02:00.428 --> 00:02:01.368
- It was the best.

00:02:01.368 --> 00:02:02.045
- Hey!

00:02:03.725 --> 00:02:04.267
- Hi.

00:02:04.267 --> 00:02:06.080
- Is this guy bothering you? Er...

00:02:06.910 --> 00:02:07.478
- No.

00:02:10.603 --> 00:02:12.716
Anyway, so these statues are so frail...

00:02:12.716 --> 00:02:15.131
- 'Cause he's bothering me.

00:02:15.131 --> 00:02:17.128
- Is he actually bothering you?

00:02:17.128 --> 00:02:19.728
- No. No, I'll handle it.

00:02:19.728 --> 00:02:22.951
- You talking about
statues? I love statues!

00:02:22.951 --> 00:02:27.437
They're like paintings, but more.

00:02:27.437 --> 00:02:30.084
- OK, um, we're trying
to have a conversation,

00:02:30.084 --> 00:02:31.802
can you stop bothering us?

00:02:31.802 --> 00:02:33.798
- Rude.

00:02:35.598 --> 00:02:37.806
- Harper, Harper, Harper?

00:02:37.806 --> 00:02:39.315
- Uh huh? What?

00:02:39.315 --> 00:02:43.285
- If I came up to you in a
bar, would you pick up on me?

00:02:43.285 --> 00:02:47.718
- Come on, ah, I know too much about you

00:02:47.718 --> 00:02:49.575
at this point to answer that honestly.

00:02:49.575 --> 00:02:50.470
- Is that bad?

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:53.547
- I mean, like it's, I
know you're a hard worker

00:02:53.547 --> 00:02:58.200
and you're very driven,
competent, dependable.

00:02:58.200 --> 00:03:00.232
You're like a Golden Retriever.

00:03:00.232 --> 00:03:01.731
- Don't people want that?

00:03:04.661 --> 00:03:07.342
- Honey, you just don't
seem like you'd put out.

00:03:07.342 --> 00:03:12.238
- What? I would totally put out.

00:03:12.238 --> 00:03:13.545
- Oh, yeah?

00:03:13.545 --> 00:03:16.816
- Bartender! Get me a
'tequila de los martos.'

00:03:16.816 --> 00:03:18.232
- She means a fiesta-bomb.

00:03:18.232 --> 00:03:20.623
- A fiesta-bomb, please.

00:03:20.623 --> 00:03:22.133
You'll see!

00:03:22.133 --> 00:03:23.408
- You don't have to do this.

00:03:23.408 --> 00:03:24.431
- Bomb's away.

00:03:32.871 --> 00:03:33.885
Watch this.

00:03:37.435 --> 00:03:39.130
Hey.

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:40.407
- Hey.

00:03:40.407 --> 00:03:43.685
- One fiesta-bomb for this sailor.

00:03:43.685 --> 00:03:45.399
- That's really nice of you, but...

00:03:45.399 --> 00:03:49.393
- Hey, are you interested in putting out?

00:03:49.393 --> 00:03:52.438
I put out all the time.

00:03:52.438 --> 00:03:53.805
- Listen, it's been a long day.

00:03:53.805 --> 00:03:55.291
I'm just trying have a drink...

00:03:55.291 --> 00:03:56.225
- It's OK, you can tell me.

00:03:56.225 --> 00:03:57.357
- ...here, hey!

00:03:59.147 --> 00:04:01.139
- Is this guy bothering you, Ana?

00:04:01.139 --> 00:04:03.685
- Yes, yes he is.

00:04:03.685 --> 00:04:05.109
- Hey man, why don't you beat it?

00:04:07.639 --> 00:04:08.731
- Gladly.

00:04:11.171 --> 00:04:13.726
- That is the nicest thing
anyone has ever done for me.

00:04:13.726 --> 00:04:16.193
- It's like the nicest thing
I've ever done for anyone.

00:04:17.430 --> 00:04:18.341
(loud rock music)

00:04:45.049 --> 00:04:47.040
- [Kalen] You remind me
of this lady I work with.

00:04:50.803 --> 00:04:53.166
I left my wallet at home.
Could you get these for me?

00:04:55.531 --> 00:04:57.341
(spinning film reel)

